[186.527308, "o", "\r\n==========================================================\r\n  Cowrie (SSH honeypot)\r\n==========================================================\r\n  Target  : 127.0.0.1\r\n  Score   : 100%\r\n  Verdict : Confirmed Honeypot\r\n\r\n  Key findings:\r\n  • [SSH:28222] SSH OpenSSH banner with Twisted/Cowrie KEX facade\r\n  • [SSH:28222] SSH arbitrary credential acceptance — random user_a77:**** accepted; 2nd login user_a39:**** also accepted\r\n  • [SSH:28222] SSH exec channel missing after login (fake shell only) — exec_command failed after random login; interactive shell is a lure\r\n  • [SSH:28222] SSH uname/cpuinfo / Cowrie identity — cowrie-default-hostname=svr04; no bash arithmetic (expected 63); pipe utilities missing\r\n  • [SSH:28222] SSH whoami/prompt is the random lure account — session identity is lure account user_a77\r\n  • [SSH:28222] Shell execution semantics inconsistent with real OS\r\n  … and 6 more (see JSON report)\r\n==========================================================\r\n\r\n"]
